Other sealed metrics, selected against additive: pearson_delta without own targets 0.719 against 0.711. Shared genes: on the visible validation perturbations the overlap-robust SE is 0.89 times the plain paired SE (63 perturbations, 42 genes, 416 ordered pairs sharing a gene); the leave-one-gene-out jackknife first specified, which exceeds 1 even for independent pairs, gives 1.43; the arm reading inflates the sealed SE by the first when above 1.

